 "intro_zh": "桃花源景区位于重庆避暑胜地酉阳县城近郊的大山之中，被认为是陶渊明《桃花源记》的原型地。景区由世外桃源、太古洞、酉州古城、桃花源国家森林公园、二酉山等等景点组成。",
 "intro_en": "Peach Blossom Spring Scenic Area is located in the mountains on the outskirts of Youyang County, a summer resort in Chongqing. It is considered to be the prototype of Tao Yuanming's \"Peach Blossom Spring\". The scenic spot consists of Utopia, Taikoo Cave, Youzhou Ancient City, Taohuayuan National Forest Park, Eryou Mountain and other attractions.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
